    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22775" root="شقو" body-key="$">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشقاهُ ٱللّٰهُ</span></b>  <i>God caused him to be unprosperous, unfortunate, unhappy,</i> or <i>miserable;
contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْعَدَهُ</span>: (S, * Msb, TA:) or <i>God caused
him to be in a state of straitness, distress, adversity,</i> or <i>difficulty:</i> and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقَاهُ</span></b> . (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشقى</span> <i>He combed.</i> (AZ, K. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْقًى</span>.])

